menu "DualEye"

    config DUALEYE_AUDIO_BOOT_CHIME
        bool "Play a chime on boot"
        default n
        help
            Audio bring-up aid: play a short two-note chime once the codecs are up.

    config DUALEYE_VOICE_BARGE_IN
        bool "Wake word interrupts the board's speech (barge-in)"
        default y
        help
            Saying the wake word while the board talks stops it and listens.
            Echo cancellation keeps the board's own voice from waking it; turn
            this off if it wakes itself up anyway (the wake word is then
            ignored while the speaker plays).

endmenu
